{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.poster.avif?t=1773683325\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.webm?t=1773683325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.mp4?t=1773683325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcadian Days is a solo developed exploration game that encourages player initiative and curiosity as they discover the world of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration in dense open-world filled with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a one-of-a-kind world, inspired by Romanian and Eastern European landscapes, filled with detail and a relaxing music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hard quests. No combat. No frills. Just you, the land and your senses of discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice-of-life stories that you can complete at your own pace.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist interface for maximum immersion. Simple, tactile actions that reflect a child's view of the world\u2014creative, emotional, and free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord for announcements, development updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610170?t=1773683325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610170?t=1773683325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/b9f5746faa2a6d402da7f3966b71456704acc7e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773683325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/b9f5746faa2a6d402da7f3966b71456704acc7e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773683325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.poster.avif?t=1773683325\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.webm?t=1773683325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/extras/49b03b386f16a8fa521b41a19f0a1323.mp4?t=1773683325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcadian Days is a solo developed exploration game that encourages player initiative and curiosity as they discover the world of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration in dense open-world filled with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a one-of-a-kind world, inspired by Romanian and Eastern European landscapes, filled with detail and a relaxing music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hard quests. No combat. No frills. Just you, the land and your senses of discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice-of-life stories that you can complete at your own pace.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist interface for maximum immersion. Simple, tactile actions that reflect a child's view of the world\u2014creative, emotional, and free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord for announcements, development updates, behind-the-scenes content, and more!</p>","developers":["IMMERSIV GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610170/eecbab56a6bc45a690a20e67860a8b7927e6bb2d/header.jpg?t=1773683325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/958251096/3153d470b967a08aacf44840bbcbe6f6abdbcd61/1765919131/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765920004","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/958251096/3153d470b967a08aacf44840bbcbe6f6abdbcd61/1765919131/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765920004","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/958251096/3153d470b967a08aacf44840bbcbe6f6abdbcd61/1765919131/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765920004","id":257141382,"name":"Bucuria, Open Country","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141382/0d68e5d7f84da84e7f5c1e7cebb1b84f01d06b45/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765920004"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610170/616886119/64c89eb49fdfe168ebcf496d9788f3393eaf8524/1753204609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765920005","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/36101